compress this frame\n42\t                                 or an error code if it fails (which can be tested using ZSTDv01_isError())\n43\t     dBound (output parameter) : an upper-bound for the decompressed size of the data in the frame\n44\t                                 or ZSTD_CONTENTSIZE_ERROR if an error occurs\n45\t\n46\t    note : assumes `cSize` and `dBound` are _not_ NULL.\n47\t */\n48\tvoid ZSTDv02_findFrameSizeInfoLegacy(const void *src, size_t srcSize,\n49\t                                     size_t* cSize, unsigned long long* dBound);\n50\t\n51\t/**\n52\tZSTDv02_isError() : tells if the result of ZSTDv02_decompress() is an error\n53\t*/\n54\tunsigned ZSTDv02_isError(size_t code);\n55\t\n56\t\n57\t/* *************************************\n58\t*  Advanced functions\n59\t***************************************/\n60\ttypedef struct ZSTDv02_Dctx_s ZSTDv02_Dctx;\n61\tZSTDv02_Dctx* ZSTDv02_createDCtx(void);\n62\tsize_t ZSTDv02_freeDCtx(ZSTDv02_Dctx* dctx);\n63\t\n64\tsize_t ZSTDv02_decompressDCtx(void* ctx,\n65\t                              void* dst, size_t maxOriginalSize,\n66\t                        const void* src, size_t compressedSize);\n67\t\n68\t/* *************************************\n69\t*  Streaming functions\n70\t***************************************/\n71\tsize_t ZSTDv02_resetDCtx(ZSTDv02_Dctx* dctx);\n72\t\n73\tsize_t ZSTDv02_nextSrcSizeToDecompress(ZSTDv02_Dctx* dctx);\n74\tsize_t ZSTDv02_decompressContinue(ZSTDv02_Dctx* dctx, void* dst, size_t maxDstSize, const void* src, size_t srcSize);\n75\t/**\n76\t  Use above functions alternatively.\n77\t  ZSTD_nextSrcSizeToDecompress() tells how much bytes to provide as 'srcSize' to ZSTD_decompressContinue().\n78\t  ZSTD_decompressContinue() will use previous data blocks to improve compression if they are located prior to current block.\n79\t  Result is the number of bytes regenerated within 'dst'.\n80\t  It can be zero, which is not an error; it just means ZSTD_decompressContinue() has decoded so